          "java",
          "// Stack decorators - each adds behavior\nDataSource source = new LoggingDecorator(\n    new EncryptionDecorator(\n        new CompressionDecorator(\n            new StringDataSource())));\n\nsource.writeData(\"Sensitive information\");\nString result = source.readData(); // \"Sensitive information\"\n// Data was logged, encrypted, and compressed transparently"
